msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.13.3, our third maintenance release for the 3.13 release train."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This release contains bugfixes and documentation improvements.\n"
"It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.13."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"One important change is that we downgraded Apache Commons Lang from 3.16.0 to 3.14.0,\n"
"because of a change in behavior as to the default source of entropy.\n"
"It is causing some severe issues (including the application completely stalling),\n"
"in particular with https://github.com/liquibase/liquibase/issues/6178[Liquibase]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can find more information about this issue https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/LANG-1748[here].\n"
"We will wait for the Java ecosystem to adapt to this change before upgrading again."
msgstr ""

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.13, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.13."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are not already using 3.13, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.13[3.13] migration guide."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.13.3[the full changelog of 3.13.3 on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
